    {
      "source": "An implementation of ApplicationEventPublisher that will only fire <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContextEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContextEvent</code></a>s for use by the index\ncreator when MongoTemplate is used 'stand-alone', that is not declared inside a Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>.\nDeclare <a href=\"../MongoTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoTemplate</code></a> inside an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> to enable the publishing of all persistence events\nsuch as <a href=\"../mapping/event/AfterLoadEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>AfterLoadEvent</code></a>, <a href=\"../mapping/event/AfterSaveEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>AfterSaveEvent</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "这是一个仅当 MongoTemplate 以“独立”方式使用（即未声明在 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 中）时，才会为索引创建器触发 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContextEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContextEvent</code></a> 的 ApplicationEventPublisher 实现。  \n请将 <a href=\"../MongoTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoTemplate</code></a> 声明在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 中，以启用发布所有持久化事件（例如 <a href=\"../mapping/event/AfterLoadEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>AfterLoadEvent</code></a>、<a href=\"../mapping/event/AfterSaveEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>AfterSaveEvent</code></a> 等）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
